{"repositoryId":1069840008,"availability":"available","full":"smithclay/duckdb-otlp","name":"duckdb-otlp","description":"stream, store, and query OpenTelemetry metrics, logs, and traces (OTLP) in duckdb","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":94,"forks":3,"created":"2025-10-04T18:14:23Z","updated":"2026-10-15T18:55:25Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://smithclay.github.io/duckdb-otlp/","topics":["duckdb","duckdb-extension","object-storage","opentelemetry","parquet"],"demo":"https://smithclay.github.io/duckdb-otlp/demo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.605Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.605Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.605Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.605Z","stars":94,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your telemetry, in your own storage, answerable in SQL.","Receives OpenTelemetry over OTLP and OTAP and streams it into Parquet files, DuckLake, or Iceberg catalogs like Amazon S3 Tables and Cloudflare R2 Data Catalog — no collector to run, no cluster to size, no vendor to pay. Query it with DuckDB, or anything else that reads Parquet.","It ships two ways. As a DuckDB extension, it adds readotlp / readotap table functions and an embedded HTTP/gRPC ingest server to any DuckDB session. As a single binary (duckdb-otlp), it runs that same server standalone or in Docker, and doubles as a CLI for one-off conversion, export, and queries. Both speak OTLP and the OpenTelemetry Arrow protocol (OTAP)."],"features":["Stream live telemetry over OTLP (otlpserve — OTLP/HTTP, or standard OTLP/gRPC unary with transport := 'grpc') or the OpenTelemetry Arrow Protocol (otapserve — OTAP/Arrow bidirectional gRPC streaming) into the default…","Convert telemetry to Parquet files and save to cloud storage.","Query local files, globs, S3, HTTP(S), Azure Blob, and GCS paths through DuckDB file systems.","Use the browser demo for JSON, JSONL, and protobuf exploration with DuckDB-WASM: Interactive Demo."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smithclay/duckdb-otlp/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4a8991c3d994d2ac4eac78faa1d7670da2fdf7680d546e80c4ee6e4b2cdcadb7","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.726Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.726Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your telemetry, in your own storage, answerable in SQL.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smithclay/duckdb-otlp/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Send one hello-world log in OTLP/HTTP format with cURL:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smithclay/duckdb-otlp/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"4a8991c3d994d2ac4eac78faa1d7670da2fdf7680d546e80c4ee6e4b2cdcadb7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smithclay/duckdb-otlp/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.727Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T18:55:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/smithclay/duckdb-otlp/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T05:07:02.728Z","hash":"4a8991c3d994d2ac4eac78faa1d7670da2fdf7680d546e80c4ee6e4b2cdcadb7","originalBytes":13508,"storedBytes":13508,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["otlp","read","otap","install","duckdb","duckdb-otlp","data","opentelemetry","ingest","server","grpc","metrics","see","arrow","extension","http","local","logs","serve","cli","live","reference","same","sql","body","ducklake","files","name","path","query","traces","nano","over","protocol","rows","running","start","time","unix","via","binary","buffered","catalog","curl","file","github","load","release","run","schemas","select","service","severity","stream","token","after","daemon","docker","flush","histogram","json","license","schema","stop","text","trace","uri","amazon","api","attributes","binary.","brew","builds","cloudflare","code","collector","commands","commits","community","contributing.md","demo","dev-token-123456","docs","duration","functions